Usage:
    tojunk <type><mode>:<target>

type:
    f = file
    d = directory
    sf = symlink file
    sd = symlink directory

mode:
    0 = for default

example:
    tojunk f0755:myfile.txt
    tojunk d0755:myfolder/
    tojunk sf0755:symlink.file
    tojunk sd0755:symlink.d
    tojunk "f0:$HOME/log.txt, sf0:/usr/bin/tool, f0644:/etc/something"